%%{init: {"theme":"neutral","sequence":{"mirrorActors":false,"actorMargin":40,"messageMargin":32,"width":170,"boxMargin":8,"noteMargin":8}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant JS as Jetstream<br/>(wss)
  participant C as Consumer<br/>goroutine
  participant S as Stats<br/>collector
  participant Q as writeCh<br/>(50k buffer)
  participant F as Write<br/>flusher
  participant DB as SQLite<br/>writeDB

  C->>DB: GetCursor
  Note over C: cursor older than 6 h → start from live tail<br/>otherwise rewind 5 s so in-flight events replay
  C->>JS: connect ?wantedCollections=app.bsky.feed.post&cursor=…
  Note over JS,C: read deadline 60 s · ping every 30 s

  loop every frame
    JS-->>C: commit event (JSON)
    C->>C: bytes-level lang scan, first 256 bytes of "langs"
    alt non-English post create
      C->>S: firehose +1 · language[tag] +1 (OnEarlyReject)
    else parsed event
      C->>S: firehose +1 · language[tag] +1
      opt English, non-empty text
        C->>C: tokenize for topics (root posts, ≤1 hashtag, not repetitive)
        C->>Q: PendingWrite (blocks ≤2 s when full, then drop + count)
      end
    end
  end

  loop every 2 s or 1500 rows
    Q-->>F: batch
    F->>DB: FlushPostBatch → post_buffer
    F->>DB: FlushTokenBatch → topic_tokens
    Note over F: flush over 1 s logs slow_flush
  end

  loop every 10 s
    C->>DB: SaveCursor(time_us of last event)
  end
